{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11808","headline":"舍弟观赴蓝田取妻子到江陵喜寄三首 二 · 杜甫","name":"舍弟观赴蓝田取妻子到江陵喜寄三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马度秦关雪正深，北来肌骨苦寒侵。\n他乡就我生春色，故国移居见客心。\n賸欲提携如意舞，喜多行坐白头吟。\n巡檐索共梅花笑，冷蘂疎枝半不禁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}